From: Cole Munz <Munzzyy1@proton.me>

sandbox_spl does not enable CONFIG_SPL_GZIP, so load_simple_fit() has
no gzip coverage either.

Enable it and add FIT_INTERNAL_GZIP and FIT_EXTERNAL_GZIP the same way
as the LZMA and zstd pairs, registered for the NOR loader.

The blob is generate_data() output for the seed "gzip", compressed
with:

  gzip -9n -c plain.bin    (gzip 1.14)

-n keeps the timestamp and file name out of the header so the blob is
reproducible.

Signed-off-by: Cole Munz <Munzzyy1@proton.me>
[alchark: pick the blob by the IH_COMP_* image_compression() now returns,
check for gzip the way image_supported() now checks for lzma, and keep
the algorithms in alphabetical order]
Signed-off-by: Alexey Charkov <alchark@flipper.net>
---
 configs/sandbox_spl_defconfig |   1 +
 include/test/spl.h            |  10 ++
 test/image/spl_load.c         | 360 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 test/image/spl_load_nor.c     |   2 +
 4 files changed, 373 insertions(+)

diff --git a/configs/sandbox_spl_defconfig b/configs/sandbox_spl_defconfig
index b8c51988ef5c..6d462a03be0d 100644
--- a/configs/sandbox_spl_defconfig
+++ b/configs/sandbox_spl_defconfig
@@ -235,6 +235,7 @@ CONFIG_RSA_VERIFY_WITH_PKEY=y
 CONFIG_TPM=y
 CONFIG_ZSTD=y
 CONFIG_SPL_LZMA=y
+CONFIG_SPL_GZIP=y
 CONFIG_SPL_ZSTD=y
 CONFIG_ERRNO_STR=y
 CONFIG_SPL_HEXDUMP=y
diff --git a/include/test/spl.h b/include/test/spl.h
index e7f46e8b4e9e..7bf8971536f1 100644
--- a/include/test/spl.h
+++ b/include/test/spl.h
@@ -32,9 +32,11 @@ void generate_data(char *data, size_t size, const char *test_name);
  * @LEGACY_LZMA: "Legacy" uImages, LZMA compressed
  * @IMX8: i.MX8 Container images
  * @FIT_INTERNAL: FITs with internal data
+ * @FIT_INTERNAL_GZIP: FITs with internal data, gzip compressed
  * @FIT_INTERNAL_LZMA: FITs with internal data, LZMA compressed
  * @FIT_INTERNAL_ZSTD: FITs with internal data, Zstandard compressed
  * @FIT_EXTERNAL: FITs with external data
+ * @FIT_EXTERNAL_GZIP: FITs with external data, gzip compressed
  * @FIT_EXTERNAL_LZMA: FITs with external data, LZMA compressed
  * @FIT_EXTERNAL_ZSTD: FITs with external data, Zstandard compressed
  */
@@ -43,9 +45,11 @@ enum spl_test_image {
 	LEGACY_LZMA,
 	IMX8,
 	FIT_INTERNAL,
+	FIT_INTERNAL_GZIP,
 	FIT_INTERNAL_LZMA,
 	FIT_INTERNAL_ZSTD,
 	FIT_EXTERNAL,
+	FIT_EXTERNAL_GZIP,
 	FIT_EXTERNAL_LZMA,
 	FIT_EXTERNAL_ZSTD,
 };
@@ -100,6 +104,8 @@ int check_image_info(struct unit_test_state *uts, struct spl_image_info *info1,
